ags-cd N/CakeRush
IF EXISTS WHDSaves:CakeRush/savedata
  copy WHDSaves:CakeRush/savedata savedata ALL CLONE QUIET
ENDIF
cake_rush_1.2 >NIL:
ags-cd N/CakeRush
IF EXISTS savedata
  IF NOT EXISTS WHDSaves:CakeRush
    makedir WHDSaves:CakeRush
  ENDIF
  copy savedata WHDSaves:CakeRush/savedata ALL CLONE QUIET
ENDIF
